{"id": "txt-1895656fef-000443067-000443156", "family": "txt-1895656fef-000443067-000443156", "duplicate_of": null, "page": null, "quote": "the sort of fanaticism which will probably\r\nseem as blind and cruel to future generations", "context": "", "speaker": "Lewis Mumford", "source_verified": true, "source_verification": {"method": "txt_aligned_exact_span_normalized", "sha256": "1895656fef52e428de8ec830ecc7154f445ef7d3138642fad3d561b06f169ca2"}, "source_location": {"type": "txt", "line_start": 7706, "line_end": 7707, "char_start": 443067, "char_end": 443156, "source_sha256": "1895656fef52e428de8ec830ecc7154f445ef7d3138642fad3d561b06f169ca2"}, "kind": "prediction", "claim": "作者判断，继续抓住民族国家神话的狂热，在后代看来大概会显得又盲目又残酷。", "time_text": "future generations", "condition_text": "", "method": "用今日对异端迫害的看法类比后代对民族国家狂热的看法。probably 保留。", "method_basis": "explicit", "extraction": null, "review": null, "legacy": {"units": []}, "extraction_v2": {"kind": "prediction", "claim": "作者判断，继续抓住民族国家神话的狂热，在后代看来大概会显得又盲目又残酷。", "time_text": "future generations", "condition_text": "", "method": "用今日对异端迫害的看法类比后代对民族国家狂热的看法。probably 保留。", "method_basis": "explicit", "reason": "probably 不删除。future generations 只照抄，不补年份。", "expanded_claim": "Lewis Mumford 说，面对不断的战争、瘟疫和精神荒废仍抓住民族国家神话，这种狂热在后代看来大概会像今日看异端迫害一样盲目而残酷。", "reference_resolutions": [], "unresolved_references": [], "claim_type": "forecast", "changes": "seem as blind and cruel to future generations", "horizon": "future generations", "horizon_source": "explicit", "confidence": "medium", "resolvable": true, "id": "txt-1895656fef-000443067-000443156", "extraction_version": "v5", "model_kind": "prediction", "attribution": "author", "future_oriented": true, "policy_flags": ["explicit"], "model_quote": "the sort of fanaticism which will probably seem as blind and cruel to future generations", "quote_alignment": {"method": "normalized", "ratio": 1.0, "in_body": true}, "provenance": {"stage": "txt_discover", "source_sha256": "1895656fef52e428de8ec830ecc7154f445ef7d3138642fad3d561b06f169ca2", "prompt_sha256": "b7aed8488b66ed9f74ff0e27d20830e7214ca26198c3f973a0609e635d689cc4", "config_sha256": "7b215056e59e715b2ed46b4ccb64206dd9f35e2b2ce61ca98e25bd66521d4a2c", "source_fields_sha256": "a47453e3d985e1bf0300c13a31cf1eefc984710afcc8561cc210a91dc88bd095", "extraction_fields_sha256": "6e0eacee6bed1a63397f697aaa25b65680cc9f9d01cba500f002314e28d132c5", "extraction_version": "v5"}}, "assessment": {"inclusion": "forecast", "verdict": "部分符合", "basis": "observed_window", "trend_aligned": false, "condition_state": "unconditional", "future_time_text": "future generations", "observation_end": "2018-12-31", "evidence_ids": ["ev-ndu-nationalism"], "scope": "对象是面对战争仍抓住民族国家神话的狂热。probably 不是全体后代一致。", "reason": "这一章写，两次大战的遗产是民族主义这个词变得和造成屠杀的人性黑暗面同义，评论几乎反射性地把它看成黑暗力量。欧洲因为屠杀而认为必须减弱对故土的忠诚。这是后代看来盲目而残酷的一截。同一页写这种看法是漫画，理想被扭曲并不取消理想，而且民族主义仍在推动政治。所以不是全体后代都这样看。", "limitation": "页面把对象写成民族主义，比原文的那种狂热宽。一百周年没有印出日，观察终点用2018年年末。", "method": "先看战争造成的狂热在后代评论里是否显得残酷，再看是不是所有后代都如此。", "method_basis": "explicit", "id": "txt-1895656fef-000443067-000443156", "receipt": {"rules": "simple-v3-trend-four-class", "response_sha256": "d4c55f6d7afbb489f06132030e207a23fb811fd31a52d532c6d336144b1de463", "input_claims_sha256": "a33b2b8190537882366bc4f2fba6b663b858e4f10ad2bac5438586eccdeb1e33", "evidence_table_sha256": "c57c0df6d24f9593868774d1362460a1b935d95f14ba7ba2aa169395143aa06b", "config_sha256": "e6351ab2e6190f38332ea8199e659446eb37f4e645aa21baedc9b313be2f7530", "reviewer": "llm_with_session_review", "human_reviewed": false, "assessment_timing": "retrospective"}}}
